  "_comment": "Sponsor logos by tier. Add a sponsor by copying an entry into the right tier. 'logo' is a path under djangocon/static/. 'art' says what the artwork looks like so the site can keep it visible on both the light and the dark theme: \"dark\" = dark/black artwork (inverted to white on the dark theme), \"light\" = white artwork (darkened on the light theme), \"colour\" = full-colour or already-legible artwork (never altered), \"colour-on-dark\" = a colour logo whose lettering is white, shown on a small dark chip so it stays readable on the light theme. Use \"colour\" for a coloured logo even if it contains white text, since inverting it would wreck the colours — supply a theme-safe file instead. Empty tiers are hidden automatically.",
